WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.810
1955.

2
00:00:01.860 --> 00:00:06.780
A professor in Washington publishes
War and Peace in the Law of Islam.

3
00:00:06.830 --> 00:00:08.470
1993.

4
00:00:08.520 --> 00:00:12.960
A Syrian preacher in Damascus
publishes Jihad in Islam.

5
00:00:13.010 --> 00:00:15.130
Both are writing about jihad.

6
00:00:15.180 --> 00:00:17.980
Both quote the Qur'an and the jurists.

7
00:00:18.030 --> 00:00:21.720
Read them side by side, and
at first they seem to clash.

8
00:00:21.770 --> 00:00:23.220
Why would that be?

9
00:00:23.270 --> 00:00:26.770
In this mission, you'll unpack
each writer's argument in turn,

10
00:00:26.820 --> 00:00:28.480
in plain paraphrase.

11
00:00:28.530 --> 00:00:31.410
Then you'll set them side by side: method,

12
00:00:31.460 --> 00:00:34.800
key verses, authority
and the inner struggle.

13
00:00:34.850 --> 00:00:39.000
Your mission: work out why these
two scholars seem to disagree.
